            <h2>What Just Happened on June 15</h2>
            <p>Anthropic's deprecation policy gives 60 days' notice for stable model IDs, but Sonnet 4 and Opus 4 followed an accelerated timeline because both have been superseded by Sonnet 4.6 (released April 2026) and Opus 4.8 (released May 2026). The June 15 cutoff aligned with the Fable 5 / Mythos 5 launch window so customers would migrate to the new frontier line rather than the 4.x refresh tier.</p>

            <p>Concretely, after June 15 at 18:00 UTC the following model IDs return <code>404 not_found_error</code>:</p>

            <ul>
